y of Sherlock Holmes\u2019 disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/c582c5020d584900e6e3799b6987be52.webp?t=1765469636\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/c582c5020d584900e6e3799b6987be52.poster.avif?t=1765469636\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=201 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Two game modes so you can choose how to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Difficulty progression designed for learning and mastery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Mix of mechanics: classic Picross + a short investigation story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Stage sizes from 10x10 to 25x25 \u2014 120 levels with varying difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Relaxing music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Hint system to help with puzzle solving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Beautiful, cozy visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Clean and easy-to-understand interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/f946ee401f6a0256707d5125d3c4a78b.poster.avif?t=1765469636\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/f946ee401f6a0256707d5125d3c4a78b.webm?t=1765469636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728040/extras/f946ee401f6a0256707d5125d3c4a78b.mp4?t=1765469636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose your favorite mode, complete all 120 nonograms, and enjoy a unique puzzle experience.</p>","developers":["LUDO Thinking"],"genres":[{"description":"Casua